====== Siemens WS-AP3610 / WS-AP3620 ======

A solid dual-band AP from 2008 with 716 Mhz Single Core CPU, 16 MB Flash and 128 MB RAM. 48V PoE (active, 802.3af), 2x gigabit ethernet ports. 
AP3610 has integrated antennas, AP3620 has three detachable dual-band antennas. Typical power consumption: 11 watts.

